Candle was added in '''Beta 39.1''' as a 4G 1/6 monster. '''Beta 47.0''' changed that to 3/3. '''Beta 49.0'''<nowiki/>'s removal of Thorns caused a redesign. It's now a 4/7 Taunt monster. But its cost only increased by 1G (though this was unmentioned), so it has a negative effect: dealing 2 DMG to all your other monsters at the end of every turn.

