* 4 (Post Beta 39.1)
* 5 (Post Beta 49.0, Current)

Abilities:
* Thorns (2). Magic: See 3 random non-DT Dust monsters. Choose 1. Add it to your hand. (Post Beta 39.1)
* Taunt. Turn end: Deal 2 DMG to all other ally monsters. (Post Beta 49.0, Current)

Rarity: Blue (Rare)
